전통이라는 이유로 사무실용 페페로를 미리 사 뒀습니다. 게임 업데이트 배포 주간이 페페로 데이와 겹치는 건 팀 단합용으로 타이밍이 좋다고 생각합니다. 성수 크리스마스 팝업도 열렸다는데, 배포 안정화 끝나고 팀원들이랑 돌아볼 예정입니다.

다만 배포 직후 바로 연말회식 시즌이 이어지는 건 매년 반복되는 패턴이라, 이번엔 회식 일정을 배포 후 일주일 뒤로 미뤄두려 합니다. 배포 직후 회식은 QA와 핫픽스에 부담이 되니까요. 다들 이번 주 과열 조심하시고, 난방비랑 유행성 독감 걱정도 잊지 마세요.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, now() - interval '8681 minutes');

Oh iya, kalau di pop-up nanti ada jajanan manis dan ada yang nekat baca labelnya, update ke gue dong, gue relawan konfirmasi bahannya 🍫 Balikin budi siap-siap, anak food science siap jadi pemandu halal gratis deket kampus 😆', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, now() - interval '7111 minutes');

1) Boiler: stopped running it all evening. Now 20°C with 예약 timer for morning and evening only, 외출 mode the rest of the time, door shut, heating one room. 2) Electric blanket comparison, done like a code review over three options: the real feature to check is an auto-off timer (1/2/4 hours), not heat levels or size. My first pick had no timer and I kept waking up at 3am sweating. The cheap market ones under 30,000 are fine if you can set it and forget it. 3) Daiso window film, bubble wrap on the glass, rolled towel under the door: trivial cost, room holds heat noticeably longer.

Net result: November bill projection downgraded from catastrophic to merely painful.

Commute note for Thursday: suneung. Buses reroute around test sites, trains briefly pause around 8:40 for the listening test, and roads near schools get traffic control. I am pushing my start to 10:00 and leaving home after 9:10. If you have an early meeting or flight, book it after 10 and check your route tonight, not Thursday morning. Kimjang with the team on Saturday — report after, assuming my back survives.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, now() - interval '6621 minutes');

然后是现实的部分：昨晚看到这个月的预估煤气账单，我盯着屏幕冷静了三秒 🥶 第一波寒潮真是不留情面。照着大家的攻略我下单了气泡膜和挡风条，锅炉调成外出模式，电热毯睡前定时 30 分钟就关。这波操作能不能救回来还不知道，但至少心里踏实了一点，十二月再战。

最后是紧急求助：周四我有个要去另一个区的客户会议，一查日历，好家伙，正好是修学能力考试(수능)当天！听说那天早上全市都给考生让路，公交绕行、考场附近还限速，打车应该也难。有没有经历过 수능 通勤的朋友？是提前一小时出门挤地铁靠谱，还是干脆把会议挪到下午，或者前一晚直接过去住酒店？在线等，挺急的 哈哈 🙏

对了，kimjang 跟同事抱回来的两箱泡菜才吃到一箱，本周晚饭菜单已经排到周日了，欢迎来江南交换泡菜料理心得 🍲', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, now() - interval '6476 minutes');

진짜 추위는 12월에 오니 지금이 챙길 때예요. 밖에 나갈 때 보일러를 완전히 끄기보다 외출 모드로 두고, 전기요는 취침 30분 전에 타이머로 켜서 잠들면 꺼지게 하세요. 창문 에어캡과 문 아래 말은 수건은 비용이 거의 안 드는데 보온 효과가 커서 저희 집 필수템이에요.

독감 주사를 아직 안 받으신 분들은 미리 받아 두시길 권해요. 요즘 클리닉들이 다들 바빠서 오전 10시 전에 가시면 줄이 훨씬 짧습니다. 오늘 수능 치르는 수험생 여러분 모두 좋은 결과 있길 응원하고, 시험장 근처는 도로 통제가 있으니 이동 계획 있으신 분들은 시간을 넉넉히 잡으세요.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, now() - interval '1948 minutes');

1) The prep list from this thread worked. Own rubber gloves in my actual size over thin cotton ones, knee pad, clothes destined for the wash. An ajumma fixed my hands mid-coating exactly as promised and nobody graded anyone.
2) The numbers held up: roughly 2.5kg coarse salt per 10 heads, packed between the thick stems, flipped once after six hours. A stem that bends without snapping means done. Cross-cut the bottom stems before salting, rinse three times after, not two.
3) Mistakes logged for next year: a knee pad helps less than standing up every 30 minutes — nothing saves you from four hours on the floor. Bring a bigger tub than you think, because your share always exceeds the estimate.
4) They sent me home with about half a tub. It fermented one day at room temperature and then went into the fridge, and by day two it tasted right. The fridge is now 30 percent kimchi and I regret nothing.

Gas bill update: the 외출 mode + 예약 20°C + timed electric blanket combo from the last patch held, this month came in just over October instead of triple. Boiler survival confirmed. Next milestone: surviving the year-end party season.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, now() - interval '897 minutes');

My prep so far: rubber gloves in my actual size with thin cotton ones underneath, a knee pad from Daiso, old clothes that can go straight into the wash, and a big empty bag since everyone says they always send you home with way more kimchi than you brought. I keep telling myself it''s like helping my mom make som tam for a temple festival, just colder, and my hands will smell like chili for days either way.

Now if my back and the gas bill both survive the weekend, I''ll call it a perfect week. If I get through it without crying over the cabbage, I''m counting it as a win and I''ll report back 🙏', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, now() - interval '107 minutes');
